Reason: (f) Writes SEAL_DSN=memory:// into .env.test when cmsig/seal-memory-adapter is installed before phpunit/phpunit; dotenv skips a .env.test that does not exist yet.
Evidence: A bare install with the adapter, then composer require --dev phpunit/phpunit, gave a .env.test without SEAL_DSN (.references/symfony-flex/src/Configurator/EnvConfigurator.php:72-75).

--- a/manifest.json
+++ b/manifest.json
@@ -9,6 +9,13 @@
             "position": "after_target",
             "target": "<deprecationTrigger>",
             "requires": ["doctrine/deprecations"]
+        },
+        {
+            "file": ".env.test",
+            "content": "SEAL_DSN=memory://",
+            "position": "after_target",
+            "target": "APP_SECRET=",
+            "requires": ["cmsig/seal-memory-adapter"]
         }
     ],
